  "starterCode": "def solve(rankings, relevant_items, k):\n    pass",
  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nVectorized, mathematically sound implementation.\n\n### ⚡ Implementation\n```python\ndef solve(rankings, relevant_items, k):\n    vals=[]\n    for ranking,relevant in zip(rankings,relevant_items):\n      vals.append(len(set(ranking[:k])&set(relevant))/len(set(relevant)) if relevant else 0.0)\n    return sum(vals)/len(vals) if vals else 0.0\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$",
